{"seq":2,"slug":"navmesh-funnel-pathfinding","title":"网格寻路与漏斗算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/navigation-meshes/navmesh-funnel-pathfinding","wordCount":1493,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"网格寻路与漏斗算法\">网格寻路与漏斗算法</h1><p>在 navmesh 上跑一遍 A* 之后，你拿到的不是一条路径，而是一串相邻的凸多边形——&quot;先穿过 7 号三角形，再到 12 号，再到 18 号&quot;。可角色要走的是脚下一条具体的折线坐标。从&quot;多边形序列&quot;到&quot;最短折线&quot;之间，隔着这一篇的主角：漏斗算法（funnel algorithm，又称 string pulling 拉绳法）。它是 navmesh 寻路区别于栅格寻路、能产出贴边而不绕路的平滑路径的关键一环，也是很多人写 navmesh 寻路时漏掉、导致路径锯齿难看的那一步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>navmesh 寻路分两个阶段，常被合称为&quot;先在图上找多边形，再在多边形里拉绳子&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[起点, 终点] --&gt; B[定位所在多边形&lt;br/&gt;点定位查询]&#10;    B --&gt; C[多边形邻接图上跑 A*&lt;br/&gt;得到多边形通道走廊]&#10;    C --&gt; D[提取每段共享边 portal&lt;br/&gt;左右端点序列]&#10;    D --&gt; E[漏斗算法 string pulling&lt;br/&gt;沿 portal 收缩漏斗]&#10;    E --&gt; F[最短折线: 一串拐点 corner]\">flowchart TD\n    A[起点, 终点] --&gt; B[定位所在多边形&lt;br/&gt;点定位查询]\n    B --&gt; C[多边形邻接图上跑 A*&lt;br/&gt;得到多边形通道走廊]\n    C --&gt; D[提取每段共享边 portal&lt;br/&gt;左右端点序列]\n    D --&gt; E[漏斗算法 string pulling&lt;br/&gt;沿 portal 收缩漏斗]\n    E --&gt; F[最短折线: 一串拐点 corner]</pre><p>第一阶段在多边形的邻接图上跑 <a href=\"../foundations/a-star-algorithm\">A*</a>（节点是多边形、边是共享门，启发用多边形质心间欧氏距离），得到一条&quot;走廊&quot;（corridor）——一串首尾相接、共享边的多边形。走廊本身只确定&quot;经过哪些房间&quot;，不确定&quot;在每个门的哪个位置穿过&quot;。第二阶段才是漏斗算法：在走廊的一系列&quot;门&quot;（portal，即相邻多边形的共享边）上，求出真正的最短折线。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>走廊 corridor</td>\n<td>A* 得到的相邻多边形序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>门 portal</td>\n<td>走廊中相邻两多边形的共享边（一条线段，有左右端点）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏斗 funnel</td>\n<td>从当前拐点出发，由左右两条边界张成的可行角度楔形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顶点 apex</td>\n<td>漏斗的尖端，即当前已确定的最后一个拐点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拐点 corner</td>\n<td>最短折线的转折点，必在某个 portal 的端点上</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>漏斗算法的核心洞察：最短路径只会在凸障碍的&quot;角&quot;上转弯，而走廊里所有的角都是 portal 的左右端点。所以最短折线一定是若干个 portal 端点连成的折线——问题归结为&quot;在每个 portal 上该不该钉一个拐点，钉左端点还是右端点&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"漏斗算法的几何直觉\">漏斗算法的几何直觉</h2><p>想象你站在起点（apex），手里有两条假想的橡皮筋分别拉向&quot;当前可见的最左边界&quot;和&quot;最右边界&quot;，这两条边界张成一个朝目标方向开口的楔形——漏斗。每来一个新 portal，就用它的左、右端点去收紧漏斗：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>新的左端点若让左边界更靠内（楔形收窄），就更新左边界；若它越过了右边界，说明左边界被右边&quot;挤穿&quot;了——右端点成为一个真正的拐点，把 apex 移到这个右端点，漏斗从这里重新张开。</li>\n<li>右端点同理对称处理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>用向量叉积判断&quot;在左还是在右、收窄还是越界&quot;：设 apex 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，当前左边界端点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，新点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，叉积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(L-A)\\times(P-A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的符号告诉你 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 在射线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AL</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 的哪一侧。整个过程对走廊的 portal 序列只扫一遍，时间复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为 portal 数），就拉出全局最短折线。这就是&quot;拉绳法&quot;名字的由来——仿佛把一根绳子从起点穿过所有门绷到终点，绳子自然绷成最短的折线，紧贴每个该转弯的角。</p>\n<h2 id=\"简化漏斗与实现要点\">简化漏斗与实现要点</h2><p>经典漏斗（Hershberger-Snoeyink 的 funnel）严格但实现繁琐。游戏里广泛使用的是 Mikko Mononen（Recast 作者）推广的简化漏斗（simple stupid funnel），用一个 apex 加左右两个端点、三类叉积判断就能写出几十行的健壮实现。几个实现要点容易踩坑：</p>\n<p>起点和终点要作为退化 portal（左右端点重合于该点）塞进序列首尾，否则路径不会真正从起点出发、到终点结束。portal 的左右定义必须全局一致（沿走廊行进方向，统一取左手边为左端点），方向反了会让漏斗逻辑全错。还要处理共线与零长 portal 的数值退化。下面这段伪代码勾勒主循环骨架：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"apex = start; left = start; right = start&#10;for portal in portals + [end_portal]:&#10;    pl, pr = portal.left, portal.right&#10;    # 收紧右边界&#10;    if triarea2(apex, right, pr) &lt;= 0:&#10;        if apex == right or triarea2(apex, left, pr) &gt; 0:&#10;            right = pr                 # 收窄&#10;        else:&#10;            push_corner(left)          # 右越过左 -&gt; 左成拐点&#10;            apex = left; left = apex; right = apex&#10;            continue&#10;    # 收紧左边界（与上对称）&#10;    ...&#10;push_corner(end)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>apex = start; left = start; right = start</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>for portal in portals + [end_portal]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pl, pr = portal.left, portal.right</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    # 收紧右边界</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if triarea2(apex, right, pr) &#x3C;= 0:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if apex == right or triarea2(apex, left, pr) > 0:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            right = pr                 # 收窄</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        else:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            push_corner(left)          # 右越过左 -> 左成拐点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            apex = left; left = apex; right = apex</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    # 收紧左边界（与上对称）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>push_corner(end)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>其中 <code>triarea2(a,b,c)</code> 返回有向面积（即叉积），符号即左右判定。这段循环跑完，<code>corners</code> 就是最短折线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与平滑-跟随的衔接\">与平滑、跟随的衔接</h2><p>漏斗算法产出的折线已经是 navmesh 内的真·最短路径，比栅格 A* 的锯齿路径自然得多，很多场景直接拿去用即可。但它仍是&quot;折线&quot;——在拐点处是硬转角，角色若严格沿折线移动会出现生硬的急转。要进一步柔化，就交给下一章的<a href=\"../movement/path-smoothing-following\">路径平滑与跟随</a>：用样条曲线圆滑拐角，或用前瞻点让角色提前打方向。</p>\n<p>需要强调漏斗与&quot;路径平滑&quot;是两件不同的事：漏斗是几何求最短（拉直），是寻路的一部分、不损失最优性；样条平滑是为了美观让路径偏离最短一点点，是移动表现层的事。把两者混为一谈，是新手实现 navmesh 移动时另一个常见误区。漏斗解决&quot;哪条折线最短&quot;，平滑解决&quot;折线怎么走得好看&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>navmesh 寻路两阶段：多边形邻接图上 A* 得到走廊（一串多边形）→ 漏斗算法在 portal 序列上求最短折线。</li>\n<li>最短折线的拐点必落在 portal 端点上；漏斗算法用 apex + 左右边界 + 叉积判定，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 一遍扫出。</li>\n<li>工业常用 Recast 作者的简化漏斗（simple stupid funnel），实现要点：首尾退化 portal、左右定义全局一致、处理数值退化。</li>\n<li>漏斗是&quot;求最短&quot;（不损最优），样条平滑是&quot;求好看&quot;（略偏离最短），二者职责不同，别混淆。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>站内前置：<a href=\"navmesh-generation\">导航网格生成</a> —— portal 来自相邻多边形的共享边。</li>\n<li>站内前置：<a href=\"../foundations/a-star-algorithm\">A* 算法</a> —— 第一阶段在多边形图上跑的就是它。</li>\n<li>站内进阶：<a href=\"../movement/path-smoothing-following\">路径平滑与跟随</a> —— 折线拐角如何柔化。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../game-ai/pathfinding/navigation-mesh\">游戏 AI · 导航网格</a> —— 决策层视角的 navmesh 寻路。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网格寻路与漏斗算法","id":"网格寻路与漏斗算法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"漏斗算法的几何直觉","id":"漏斗算法的几何直觉"},{"level":2,"text":"简化漏斗与实现要点","id":"简化漏斗与实现要点"},{"level":2,"text":"与平滑、跟随的衔接","id":"与平滑-跟随的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"导航网格生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/navigation-meshes/navmesh-generation"},"next":{"title":"动态障碍与重规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/pathfinding-navigation-mesh/navigation-meshes/dynamic-obstacles-replan"}}